WEBVTT

00:09:56.091 --> 00:10:01.263
they produce real impact
driven by real change

00:10:01.263 --> 00:10:03.974
that affect real people

00:10:03.974 --> 00:10:08.062
who have names and faces
and families and pets.

00:10:09.104 --> 00:10:10.648
Just one quick example.

00:10:10.648 --> 00:10:12.441
Our pal, Miguel,

00:10:12.441 --> 00:10:14.693
who was once incarcerated,

00:10:14.693 --> 00:10:16.987
he didn’t have any prospects
for his future,

00:10:16.987 --> 00:10:19.073
his professional life
or really, his family.

00:10:19.907 --> 00:10:22.743
He was scholarshiped
through our pre-apprenticeship program

00:10:22.743 --> 00:10:24.036
using government dollars.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.706
Miguel veered just to the left
of computer programming,

00:10:27.706 --> 00:10:31.460
landed neck-deep in analytics
and website funnels.